From 7b3c33eb74ccee6b611003381dc250c885c603a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:26:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] set-block-property and cooking recipes for the Mekanism port
 (API 14, 15)

world.set-block-property changes one property keeping the block entity (a
machine's lit); recipe-types.cooking-recipes gives the furnace recipes (the
energized smelter uses them). API level 15.
